WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.480
EPISODE 28

01:39.560 --> 01:41.640
KAIFENG COURT PRISON

01:51.640 --> 01:52.600
Mr. Huang.

01:53.520 --> 01:54.360
Mr. Xue.

01:57.320 --> 01:58.320
Bring the person up.

02:02.280 --> 02:04.600
Last night, I wanted
to interrogate an important prisoner.

02:04.680 --> 02:07.160
Kaifeng Court's Official Qiao Du

02:07.240 --> 02:11.280
lied about a malaria outbreak in prison
to escape with the female prisoner.

02:11.880 --> 02:14.280
I caught them on the spot.

02:14.360 --> 02:16.240
The incident occurred suddenly.

02:16.320 --> 02:19.440
Sorry for not informing you
in time, Lord Shen.

02:19.520 --> 02:21.000
I hope you would not blame me

02:21.080 --> 02:23.000
for overstepping my duties.

02:25.080 --> 02:26.000
I dare not.

02:27.600 --> 02:30.640
Qiao Du, what's going on?

02:32.720 --> 02:35.840
Lord Shen asked you a question.
Why don't you answer?

02:36.520 --> 02:38.400
Where are you taking this female prisoner?

02:39.000 --> 02:40.160
Fang.

02:41.600 --> 02:42.600
You tell me.

02:43.200 --> 02:44.120
Yes.

02:44.840 --> 02:47.560
It was Qiao Du who had someone
send me the drug,

02:47.640 --> 02:51.120
teaching me to feign malaria
to escape from prison.

02:51.200 --> 02:53.800
Drug? What drug?

02:53.880 --> 02:55.600
Mr. Du.

02:56.560 --> 02:58.360
These were all Mr. Qiao's order.

02:58.440 --> 03:00.920
What's wrapped is Semen Cannabis.

03:01.680 --> 03:04.360
After one takes it, they vomit
and have diarrhea, appearing delirious,

03:05.040 --> 03:06.240
just like having malaria.

03:06.320 --> 03:09.160
After the prison physician's diagnosis,
we wouldn't dare keep the patient.

03:09.240 --> 03:11.320
According to regulation,
we must send the patient away.

03:11.400 --> 03:14.440
- Where do you send her?
- To the infirmary.

03:15.240 --> 03:18.360
To find a corpse with a similar appearance

03:18.440 --> 03:22.280
to deceive everyone
that the patient has died.

03:23.200 --> 03:25.760
I have also heard rumors in the past

03:25.840 --> 03:29.120
that people often bribe prison officials
with large sums of money

03:29.200 --> 03:32.720
to secretly release prisoners,
but report them as dead from illness.

03:35.800 --> 03:37.160
I never would have thought that,

03:37.960 --> 03:40.560
Lord Shen, under your jurisdiction,

03:40.640 --> 03:42.680
such outrageous things would happen.

03:43.720 --> 03:45.000
Shen Huizhao.

03:45.600 --> 03:47.800
Qiao Du is your subordinate.

03:48.840 --> 03:49.840
How do you explain this?

03:49.920 --> 03:51.880
There is no need
for further interrogation.

03:52.600 --> 03:55.560
I believe that Lady Fang
is wrongfully accused,

03:55.640 --> 03:57.600
- so--
- Nonsense!

03:57.680 --> 03:59.600
You have no relation to Fang.

03:59.680 --> 04:03.120
Without someone's instigation,
how dare you take such a risk?

04:04.040 --> 04:05.360
Things have come to this.

04:05.440 --> 04:07.840
Yet you still attempt to use excuses
to hide the truth.

04:07.920 --> 04:09.200
Mr. Xue.

04:10.200 --> 04:11.840
You seem to imply something.

04:12.680 --> 04:16.480
Fang attempted to escape the prison,
which is doubly guilty.

04:16.560 --> 04:18.760
She should be sentenced to death
by dismemberment.

04:18.840 --> 04:22.560
I'll give you one last chance.

04:24.040 --> 04:26.240
- Tell us the truth.
- I…

04:27.560 --> 04:31.560
Do you think Shen Huizhao
can help you escape?

04:32.520 --> 04:34.400
Let me tell you the truth.

04:34.480 --> 04:38.280
Tonight, that Lu Jiulang
died of serious injury,

04:38.360 --> 04:41.120
and the Lu family
is busy preparing the funeral.

04:42.640 --> 04:45.840
Shen Huizhao has committed false judgment
and intentional prisoner release.

04:45.920 --> 04:48.080
He's in trouble himself.

04:49.080 --> 04:51.200
Now, I'm the only one in the world

04:52.920 --> 04:55.400
who can help you.

04:58.680 --> 04:59.640
Say it.

05:01.680 --> 05:04.680
- Say it.
- It's my cousin.

05:05.920 --> 05:08.120
I have been engaged to my cousin
since childhood.

05:08.720 --> 05:10.760
But due to mourning,
we missed the wedding date.

05:11.200 --> 05:13.680
I didn't expect he'd called off
the engagement and marry another.

05:13.760 --> 05:17.000
When I went to the Shen family,
they threatened me with their power,

05:17.760 --> 05:19.240
seducing me to conduct adultery.

05:19.320 --> 05:22.840
He feared that someone would expose him
and his reputation would get ruined,

05:23.840 --> 05:26.600
so he forced me
to marry into the Lu family.

05:26.680 --> 05:29.840
He told me to use the excuse of a wedding
in mourning period to escape the crime.

05:29.920 --> 05:31.520
And it was my cousin who asked Qiao Du

05:31.600 --> 05:33.240
to enter prison and save me.

05:33.320 --> 05:36.920
Stop slandering against the official.

05:37.960 --> 05:42.040
Mr. Huang, this woman is holding grudges
for the engagement being called off,

05:42.720 --> 05:43.640
so she seeks revenge,

05:44.280 --> 05:45.880
lying and framing the innocent.

05:46.480 --> 05:49.080
Every word I say is true. I dare not lie.

05:49.160 --> 05:51.040
I hope you can be lenient with me.

05:51.120 --> 05:52.560
Shen Huizhao.

05:52.640 --> 05:55.000
His Majesty holds you in great trust,

05:55.080 --> 05:58.880
allowing you not to avoid cases related
to your relatives, to judge fairly.

05:58.960 --> 06:02.360
Yet you are sanctimonious,
with unfaithful actions and words.

06:02.440 --> 06:05.440
You first forced the girl
to conduct adultery.

06:05.520 --> 06:07.680
Later, you covered up for your relatives

06:08.360 --> 06:11.880
and committed the major crime of
releasing prisoners without authorization.

06:12.480 --> 06:15.520
You committed a crime beyond forgiveness

06:15.600 --> 06:18.360
and can't hold the position
as the Chief Official of Kaifeng Court.

06:19.160 --> 06:21.080
Today, with Mr. Huang as witness,

06:21.160 --> 06:23.280
you don't have a chance
to argue with that.

06:23.880 --> 06:27.200
I must purge the imperial court
of treacherous scoundrels

06:27.280 --> 06:28.560
and petition His Majesty

06:28.640 --> 06:32.240
to severely punish you.

06:41.200 --> 06:44.560
I have judged cases impartially
and never practiced favoritism.

06:44.640 --> 06:48.120
I have no guilt towards
His Majesty, the imperial court,

06:48.200 --> 06:49.400
or the world.

06:49.480 --> 06:52.560
If you two believe what she said,

06:52.640 --> 06:54.080
you are free to petition His Majesty.

06:54.160 --> 06:57.560
I am willing to remove
my official rank and accept…

07:00.200 --> 07:01.680
all interrogation.

07:08.400 --> 07:11.600
You! I've been considerate of you,
but look at you.

07:11.680 --> 07:13.720
Colluding with that woman
and creating such a scandal.

07:14.400 --> 07:17.200
Let me ask you when you love her
and how much you love her.

07:17.280 --> 07:19.120
Don't you still want your future
and reputation?

07:19.200 --> 07:20.840
And you don't want me, your lawful wife.

07:21.480 --> 07:23.120
- Haode, listen to me.
- You shut up.

07:23.760 --> 07:27.120
Let me ask you. Did you teach that Cui

07:27.200 --> 07:28.360
to come to me?

07:28.440 --> 07:30.800
- How would she know where the entrance is?
- What's happening?

07:30.880 --> 07:32.720
How dare she cause such trouble!

07:32.800 --> 07:34.680
Marrying during the mourning period?

07:34.760 --> 07:36.600
What a ridiculous excuse!

07:36.680 --> 07:38.000
Doesn't she feel ashamed?

07:40.040 --> 07:42.040
And that Qiao Du… Don't touch me.

07:42.120 --> 07:44.320
And that Qiao Du…
I wonder why he's so anxious,

07:44.400 --> 07:46.200
like his own wife's
on the execution grounds.

07:46.280 --> 07:47.960
So, he did it all for you.

07:48.960 --> 07:51.120
In the end, I've become a pawn

07:51.880 --> 07:54.800
to be used by others.
All my good intentions wasted.

07:55.480 --> 07:57.520
Do you know?
During tomorrow's court interrogation,

07:57.600 --> 07:59.320
in public,

07:59.400 --> 08:02.120
you not only will be dismissed,
but sent to prison for the crime.

08:03.200 --> 08:06.040
You'll implicate the whole family
and become a laughingstock to others.

08:06.120 --> 08:09.840
Shen Huizhao, let's part ways.

08:09.920 --> 08:11.360
Haode.

08:17.800 --> 08:18.960
Get lost!

08:20.000 --> 08:21.160
- Go.
- Leave.

08:40.760 --> 08:42.240
We had an agreement.

08:42.320 --> 08:45.200
Just do as you said, and my lady
will be given a lighter sentence.

08:45.280 --> 08:46.240
Don't lie to me.

08:46.320 --> 08:48.880
Be patient. That day will come.

08:48.960 --> 08:50.800
I can't wait.

08:50.880 --> 08:53.840
If she can't get a lighter sentence
tomorrow, I will tell the truth at Yamen.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.320
Easy.

08:55.400 --> 08:57.840
Lady Fang has a message for you.
Come closer.

09:04.960 --> 09:07.000
KAIFENG COURT

09:23.200 --> 09:25.120
Shen Huizhao.

09:26.160 --> 09:29.480
That day you sat here
and sentenced my son to death,

09:29.560 --> 09:31.240
did you ever think that one day

09:31.320 --> 09:34.120
you would be dismissed
and put on trial, becoming

09:34.680 --> 09:36.960
a prisoner?

09:46.680 --> 09:48.520
I really never thought

09:49.640 --> 09:53.320
that my upright and unyielding teacher

09:54.800 --> 09:56.640
would become like this today.

09:56.720 --> 10:00.400
What? To go on trial,

10:00.480 --> 10:02.640
yet you still don't want
to take off your official robe?

10:03.240 --> 10:06.000
Lord Shen, after today's hearing,

10:06.080 --> 10:09.160
you, who were once known
as the upright official

10:09.240 --> 10:11.600
trusted by His Majesty,

10:11.680 --> 10:13.800
will become the villain who's despised,

10:13.880 --> 10:17.080
condemned, and cursed by everyone.

10:17.160 --> 10:19.160
By then,

10:19.240 --> 10:21.560
there will be many things
you'd never expect.

10:22.240 --> 10:26.120
Xue Guang, for your own self-desires,
you've rashly judged a lawsuit,

10:26.200 --> 10:29.840
set all sorts of traps
to frame an imperial official.

10:29.920 --> 10:31.040
Do you confess your crime?

10:34.400 --> 10:36.880
Shen Huizhao, have you lost your mind?

10:36.960 --> 10:39.320
Today, I am judging your crime.

10:39.400 --> 10:42.920
Why are you instead questioning me?

10:44.120 --> 10:46.000
Mr. Huang has arrived.

10:55.280 --> 10:56.360
Mr. Huang.

10:56.440 --> 10:58.840
Mr. Huang,
please make a fair judgment in court.

10:58.920 --> 11:01.560
No, I am here on His Majesty's order

11:01.640 --> 11:03.360
to attend the trial.

11:04.120 --> 11:05.240
Lord Shen.

11:05.320 --> 11:07.720
You have promised to His Majesty

11:07.800 --> 11:10.680
that you'd certainly
make a fair judgment on this case.

11:10.760 --> 11:12.120
I shall wait and see.

11:22.880 --> 11:27.360
Hold court trial!

11:27.440 --> 11:28.400
Bring in the prisoners.

11:42.880 --> 11:44.040
My lady.

11:44.120 --> 11:46.840
Mr. Xue, do you recognize them?

11:48.320 --> 11:52.160
These two are witnesses accusing Lord Shen
of practicing favoritism.

11:52.240 --> 11:55.640
But I don't recognize the two of them.

11:55.720 --> 11:56.800
The servant, Mao Chun,

11:57.480 --> 11:59.240
is the one
who cleaned up outside my study.

11:59.320 --> 12:01.640
After Fang Yuchan was imprisoned,

12:01.720 --> 12:03.480
he incited Lady Fang's wet nurse, Cui,

12:03.560 --> 12:06.080
and lied that Lady Fang's mourning
for her father was over

12:06.160 --> 12:08.000
so she could escape punishment.

12:08.080 --> 12:12.240
Last night, he even attempted to kill Cui,

12:12.320 --> 12:13.640
but I caught him on the spot.

12:25.120 --> 12:27.920
Cui, he wanted to kill you?

12:28.800 --> 12:31.320
My lady, I almost couldn't see you again.

12:33.960 --> 12:37.000
Lord Shen, it was Mao Chun
who convinced me

12:37.080 --> 12:40.240
that marrying during the mourning period
would result in a lighter sentence.

12:40.320 --> 12:41.760
I was eager to save my lady,

12:41.840 --> 12:43.760
so I slipped the information
to Madam Haode.

12:43.840 --> 12:45.720
I made up all these lies.

12:45.800 --> 12:47.880
I deserve to die.

12:47.960 --> 12:50.360
Lord Shen, I was merely talking nonsense
after being drunk,

12:50.440 --> 12:52.760
and I didn't expect
this old lady to believe it.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.320
When it didn't work out,
she blamed me.

12:54.400 --> 12:56.760
Thus, we only had a quarrel.

12:56.840 --> 12:58.720
I had no intention to kill her.

12:58.800 --> 13:01.200
Take him away and punish him
with 50 strokes of the cane first.

13:02.080 --> 13:04.760
- Yes.
- Lord Shen, please spare me.

13:04.840 --> 13:07.120
Lord Shen, please spare me.

13:07.720 --> 13:10.160
- Lady Fang, it'll be fine.
- Lord Shen.

13:10.240 --> 13:13.080
You practiced favoritism
and judged the case for personal gains,

13:13.160 --> 13:14.640
and found others to take the blame.

13:14.720 --> 13:16.960
Trying to escape the crime
of judging falsely?

13:17.040 --> 13:20.080
This is just too childish.

13:20.160 --> 13:23.640
No rush. Qiao Du,

13:24.800 --> 13:26.720
why did you secretly release the prisoner?

13:28.280 --> 13:31.720
All my words and actions
are all out of loyalty to you.

13:32.320 --> 13:33.680
Nonsense!

13:34.480 --> 13:36.400
Ever since I got attacked by an assassin,

13:36.480 --> 13:39.680
I suspected that someone close to me
was leaking information.

13:39.760 --> 13:42.440
I told you to go to Hangzhou again
to investigate the Fang family.

13:42.520 --> 13:44.120
It was to find out your intentions.

13:44.200 --> 13:47.040
But two days later, the man you sent
is still in the tavern

13:47.120 --> 13:49.800
30 miles from Bianjing.

13:49.880 --> 13:51.640
What is he waiting for?

13:52.280 --> 13:54.720
Naturally, he's waiting for me
to be dismissed and interrogated.

13:55.400 --> 13:57.480
I asked you
to covertly protect Lu Jiulang,

13:58.080 --> 13:59.480
yet you didn't do what I said again

13:59.560 --> 14:02.160
and went to the Li family
to stir up trouble.

14:02.240 --> 14:03.680
Don't you ever wonder

14:04.360 --> 14:06.440
why things have gone so smoothly?

14:08.600 --> 14:11.040
If that Fang Yuchan dies,

14:11.120 --> 14:14.520
then this case
would be resolved immediately, right?

14:15.240 --> 14:17.840
I asked Li Shouhua of the Li family
to cooperate with me

14:17.920 --> 14:19.720
and secretly push the progress.

14:20.320 --> 14:23.320
I just wanted to see
how this mastermind behind the scenes

14:23.400 --> 14:26.160
framed me and accused me.

14:26.960 --> 14:29.960
Regarding the prison escape, I had already
reported it to His Majesty early on.

14:30.040 --> 14:32.000
I set this trap

14:32.080 --> 14:36.040
to wait for you to be caught
by your own scheme.

14:37.920 --> 14:42.000
Qiao Du, I have given you chances
again and again.

14:42.080 --> 14:45.560
If you had realized your mistake
and mended it in time,

14:45.640 --> 14:47.880
you wouldn't end up as a prisoner.

14:48.560 --> 14:51.640
I didn't know.

14:51.720 --> 14:53.840
But do you know

14:53.920 --> 14:56.080
that the person behind this
for his own selfish desires

14:56.160 --> 14:59.080
even tried to kill Cui and Lu Jiulang?

14:59.160 --> 15:01.840
As a chivalrous martial artist
with a tender heart,

15:01.920 --> 15:04.800
you have become an accomplice to murder.

15:04.880 --> 15:06.440
Don't you regret it?

15:06.520 --> 15:09.600
I didn't know.

15:10.280 --> 15:11.200
I didn't know.

15:12.360 --> 15:13.360
- You!
- Kneel.

15:17.320 --> 15:19.480
You promised me you wouldn't kill again.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.120
You promised me

15:22.120 --> 15:23.960
that you would only
deal with Shen Huizhao alone

15:24.800 --> 15:25.880
and never kill anyone again.

15:25.960 --> 15:29.400
You lied to me!

15:30.000 --> 15:32.200
- Xue Guang, you…
- How dare you!

15:32.280 --> 15:33.960
I have been an official for decades.

15:34.040 --> 15:36.880
I don't care about any rumor or slander.

15:38.640 --> 15:41.640
Xue Guang, you still refuse to confess.

15:43.200 --> 15:45.120
- I have no crime to confess.
- Fine.

15:46.480 --> 15:49.520
I have two witnesses to come forward.

15:51.680 --> 15:53.240
Haode.

15:53.320 --> 15:56.600
Lord Shen and my husband have discussed
and set up the plan.

15:56.680 --> 15:57.880
How did you know it?

15:58.480 --> 16:00.920
Huizhao's expression and tone
towards Qiao Du

16:01.000 --> 16:03.240
seemed a bit strange,
so I paid attention to it.

16:04.040 --> 16:07.720
Besides, you are so shrewd and careful.

16:07.800 --> 16:09.920
How could you easily agree
on the prison escape?

16:10.000 --> 16:12.280
The quicker you agreed,
the more suspicious the matter.

16:14.520 --> 16:16.120
Don't be mad.

16:16.200 --> 16:19.160
I asked the two of them
to keep it from you and Leshan.

16:19.240 --> 16:21.120
Only then could we fool the others.

16:21.200 --> 16:22.320
Shouhua.

16:25.880 --> 16:27.080
Haode.

16:27.720 --> 16:29.600
Do you think that Qiao Du will confess?

16:35.880 --> 16:37.160
You…

16:38.440 --> 16:39.520
You're still alive?

16:43.800 --> 16:47.200
Qiao Du, since I have suspected you,

16:47.280 --> 16:49.360
how would I entrust
the important witness to you?

16:50.200 --> 16:53.440
Lu Sheng, is Lady Fang kneeling here

16:53.520 --> 16:55.040
the one who stabbed you?

16:55.800 --> 16:56.640
Yes.

17:00.080 --> 17:04.160
That night, she saw my ugly face
and was unwilling to marry me.

17:04.240 --> 17:07.360
She pulled out the dagger from her waist,
wanting to commit suicide.

17:08.280 --> 17:09.840
I stepped forward to stop her.

17:10.480 --> 17:12.960
In the struggle, I was mistakenly injured.

17:13.040 --> 17:16.120
It was a suicide attempt, not murder?

17:16.200 --> 17:18.600
It was a suicide attempt, not murder.

17:19.720 --> 17:23.200
Fang Yuchan, do you hear it?

17:23.280 --> 17:24.320
Tell the truth.

17:29.160 --> 17:33.240
I heard it. Please discern the truth.

17:33.320 --> 17:36.720
I am trapped in prison,
with no means to appeal.

17:38.600 --> 17:40.120
Xue Guang told me

17:40.200 --> 17:42.520
that Jiulang was already dead,

17:42.600 --> 17:44.440
and the Lu family
would certainly not let me go.

17:44.520 --> 17:46.560
He asked me to do as he said,

17:47.360 --> 17:49.800
to frame Lord Shen
for practicing favoritism,

17:49.880 --> 17:52.680
then he would seek His Majesty's pardon
to reduce my sentence.

17:53.320 --> 17:56.320
Otherwise, he would charge me
with the murder of my husband,

17:56.400 --> 17:58.840
and the crime of prison escape,

17:58.920 --> 18:00.680
and put me to death
by dismembering the body.

18:01.360 --> 18:04.240
Xue Guang, as the Minister
of Dali Supreme Court,

18:04.320 --> 18:07.040
how dare you bend the law to extract
confessions and frame a colleague?

18:07.120 --> 18:09.440
A prisoner on death row
who tried to escape prison

18:09.520 --> 18:12.360
accused Shen Huizhao firmly yesterday,

18:12.440 --> 18:14.760
yet shifted all the blame onto me today.

18:14.840 --> 18:16.680
How can you trust her?

18:17.280 --> 18:18.320
I do not accept this.

18:18.400 --> 18:20.400
You instigated the Bianjing physician
Liu Zaichang

18:20.480 --> 18:22.240
to poison Lu Jiulang to death.

18:22.320 --> 18:24.760
I caught the person and got the drug.
You can't deny it anymore.

18:24.840 --> 18:26.160
You are slandering me!

18:26.240 --> 18:29.480
I've heard how marvelous
this physician Liu's medical skills are.

18:29.560 --> 18:31.080
Yet I haven't met him.

18:31.680 --> 18:34.120
How dare you slander
the Minister of Dali Supreme Court!

18:34.200 --> 18:36.680
Xue Guang, if it weren't for you
threatening me with the evidence

18:36.760 --> 18:38.280
of my pharmacy endangering other lives…

18:38.360 --> 18:40.680
I've been practicing medicine
and saving lives for 40 years.

18:40.760 --> 18:43.240
Why would I poison my patient to death?

18:44.080 --> 18:46.880
Lord Shen, I know
that I deserve punishment.

18:46.960 --> 18:48.920
Everything I said is true.

18:49.000 --> 18:52.120
I am willing to accept the punishment
and sign my confession here in court.

18:52.200 --> 18:55.400
- I hope you won't let the mastermind go.
- Shut up.

18:56.120 --> 18:59.680
Shen Huizhao, that servant Mao Chun
is from your Shen family.

18:59.760 --> 19:01.440
Li Haode bought the Semen Cannabis.

19:01.520 --> 19:03.640
The Kaifeng Court Official
secretly released Lady Fang.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.640
They are all related to you.

19:05.720 --> 19:07.040
What does it have to do with me?

19:07.120 --> 19:09.400
With clear evidence presented,
how dare you still deny!

19:09.480 --> 19:10.920
I might have bribed one.

19:11.000 --> 19:13.080
Could I possibly bribe
all these witnesses in here?

19:33.360 --> 19:36.800
Our ancestors made laws
after careful consideration,

19:37.440 --> 19:39.040
and we should enforce the law

19:39.720 --> 19:41.760
with fairness and justice.

19:43.200 --> 19:45.200
If for one's self desires

19:46.280 --> 19:47.920
one disregards the law and justice,

19:49.360 --> 19:51.360
harming the innocents,

19:52.160 --> 19:55.680
even if one had much achievement,
they would vanish in an instant.

19:56.280 --> 19:58.920
The imperial laws couldn't tolerate you.

19:59.520 --> 20:01.240
Even the world couldn't tolerate you.

20:05.320 --> 20:06.520
Teacher…

20:09.400 --> 20:10.760
wake up.

20:32.200 --> 20:34.200
I have lost.

20:41.240 --> 20:43.240
- I didn't expect it to be true.
- What is it?

20:43.320 --> 20:45.080
- I have also heard about it.
- Yes.

20:48.760 --> 20:51.640
KAIFENG COURT

20:51.720 --> 20:54.320
Lu Jiulang bears in mind the favor
of being saved by you,

20:54.400 --> 20:55.960
so he's willing to plead for Lady Fang.

20:57.240 --> 20:58.400
What will happen to them?

20:59.720 --> 21:03.240
The Minister of Dali Supreme Court wields
great power. He violated the law.

21:03.840 --> 21:05.640
Only His Majesty
could judge his punishment.

21:06.360 --> 21:07.680
As for Qiao Du,

21:07.760 --> 21:10.640
he is sentenced to 30 canings
and to be exiled to Cangzhou.

21:11.680 --> 21:12.560
What a pity.

21:13.520 --> 21:15.960
- Let's go.
- Where to?

21:16.880 --> 21:19.560
To the Li family and bring back my wife.

21:23.080 --> 21:24.120
Jingwei.

21:26.680 --> 21:29.840
Lord Shen, my apologies. You can't go in.

21:32.920 --> 21:35.800
I'm here to pick up Haode.
Leshan, please let me in.

21:36.920 --> 21:37.760
Qingshi.

21:54.160 --> 21:55.560
Haode said

21:56.120 --> 21:59.520
you didn't complete the bride fetching,
wedding ceremony, and the temple visit.

21:59.600 --> 22:01.840
Thus, you two are not considered
as a married couple.

22:02.960 --> 22:05.960
Lord Shen, please leave.

22:11.400 --> 22:12.920
You are so rude.

22:13.640 --> 22:15.880
Lord Shen, what should we do?

22:17.760 --> 22:18.600
Go back.

22:19.560 --> 22:22.720
Lord Shen, aren't you
taking Lady Haode back?

22:23.800 --> 22:25.280
He's left?

22:25.360 --> 22:29.160
So, he's really left and never returned?

22:31.280 --> 22:33.440
He came here to pick you up.

22:33.520 --> 22:35.360
I told you not to put on an act.

22:35.440 --> 22:36.760
Now, this is great.

22:36.840 --> 22:38.720
You can't go back now.

22:39.520 --> 22:41.960
So, he could collude with
my elder brother-in-law to deceive me,

22:42.040 --> 22:43.440
but I couldn't fool him?

22:43.520 --> 22:45.320
It's not fair.

22:46.080 --> 22:49.280
He got the cold shoulder
and didn't want his wife anymore.

23:06.440 --> 23:09.000
I haven't heard of anyone nearby
having a wedding.

23:11.440 --> 23:13.200
Who is this for?

23:13.960 --> 23:15.120
Coming.

23:15.840 --> 23:17.440
- Coming.
- What?

23:17.520 --> 23:19.200
You silly girl!

23:20.440 --> 23:22.920
What are you waiting for?
Your bridal sedan chair has arrived.

23:31.360 --> 23:32.480
Huizhao.

23:38.280 --> 23:41.640
W-What are you doing?

23:42.240 --> 23:44.360
Of course, I'm here
to complete the bride fetching,

23:44.440 --> 23:46.800
wedding ceremony,
and the ancestral temple visit.

23:46.880 --> 23:49.800
I would marry you
into the Shen family in glory

23:49.880 --> 23:53.160
and make you my wife.

24:03.120 --> 24:07.880
Huizhao, so you knew everything all along.

24:08.640 --> 24:10.440
I'm so delighted.

24:10.520 --> 24:11.640
Just hold on

24:11.720 --> 24:13.640
and change into your wedding attire.

24:14.200 --> 24:16.360
Old Lady is waiting
for her daughter-in-law to offer tea.

24:16.440 --> 24:18.680
Haode.

24:20.720 --> 24:22.040
You girl!

24:22.120 --> 24:24.040
The makeup isn't even finished yet.

24:24.720 --> 24:27.320
Wait for me. Coming.

24:27.920 --> 24:28.960
Hurry up.

24:29.040 --> 24:30.040
Hurry up.

24:36.200 --> 24:37.560
You can't catch up.

24:41.120 --> 24:43.280
- Congratulations, Lord Shen.
- Congratulations, Lord Shen.

24:43.360 --> 24:45.040
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

24:45.840 --> 24:47.720
- Congratulations.
- Bravo.

24:47.800 --> 24:48.680
What a joy.

24:48.760 --> 24:50.200
Congratulations, Lord Shen.

24:52.600 --> 24:54.200
Congratulations, Lord Shen.

25:10.560 --> 25:14.400
Mother, sister, where are you?

25:14.480 --> 25:18.240
Mother, sister, where are you?

25:21.600 --> 25:24.120
Where are you?

25:26.120 --> 25:27.240
Why are you here all alone?

25:34.520 --> 25:37.320
My mother is so biased.
I don't want to see her.

25:37.400 --> 25:41.040
But I miss home so much,
and I miss my mother.

25:42.960 --> 25:45.320
Let's go. I'll take you home.

26:26.920 --> 26:32.400
SECOND DAY OF THE THIRD MONTH

26:34.520 --> 26:35.600
This won't do.

26:35.680 --> 26:38.120
Yesterday, I was busy preparing the room.

26:38.200 --> 26:41.240
Didn't I ask you to replace
the fruit on the tray with the best?

26:41.840 --> 26:43.800
Mom, Lamian tea costs 200 coins a catty.

26:43.880 --> 26:46.480
We don't bear drink it ourselves,
yet you say it isn't good enough.

26:46.560 --> 26:48.200
You don't know anything.

26:48.280 --> 26:51.720
Change it to the best Hunan Mountain Tea.
Can't let the He family look down on us.

26:51.800 --> 26:54.640
- Hurry!
- Alright.

26:54.720 --> 26:56.520
Wine.

27:01.320 --> 27:03.560
A jar must hold four catties of water.

27:04.160 --> 27:06.120
Mom, it was you who mixed the water in it.

27:06.200 --> 27:08.120
And you even complained
that it was too little.

27:09.000 --> 27:10.880
I mixed it myself?

27:10.960 --> 27:13.120
The new son-in-law comes to visit us,
can it be the same?

27:13.200 --> 27:15.440
Madame He is a meticulous person.

27:15.520 --> 27:17.360
We can't let the He family
look down on Leshan.

27:17.440 --> 27:18.280
Hurry up. Go.

27:18.360 --> 27:19.200
- Go change it.
- Okay.

27:19.280 --> 27:20.240
Go change it.

27:22.800 --> 27:23.800
Two, four…

27:23.880 --> 27:25.560
Hurry up. Mother-in-law.

27:25.640 --> 27:27.680
The groom's family is coming
with the betrothal gifts.

27:27.760 --> 27:30.240
The person urging the bride to dress
is near the alley entrance.

27:30.840 --> 27:33.480
Qiongnu, Chunlai.
Double-check the gifts in return.

27:33.560 --> 27:34.440
- Okay.
- Leshan.

27:34.520 --> 27:37.000
- Have you finished your makeup, Leshan?
- Come over.

27:38.040 --> 27:39.760
Lianghan, you go with An

27:39.840 --> 27:42.440
to the gate to welcome them.
Don't slight the bride's fetching team.

27:42.520 --> 27:43.400
- Go now.
- Okay.

27:43.480 --> 27:46.840
Leshan, my dear, are you done
with your makeup yet?

27:46.920 --> 27:47.880
Leshan.

27:47.960 --> 27:51.480
- The bride's fetching team is already--
- Mother. Alright, don't rush her.

27:51.560 --> 27:53.600
They are all waiting.

27:53.680 --> 27:56.160
- If we make them wait too long…
- Coming. Look.

28:44.840 --> 28:45.880
Are you still

28:46.600 --> 28:48.520
my dear Leshan?

28:50.480 --> 28:52.960
She got up to do her makeup
early last night.

28:53.040 --> 28:54.080
You said

28:55.200 --> 28:59.000
we have to let all the relatives, friends,
and neighbors know how great Leshan is.

28:59.080 --> 29:00.960
This also brings honor to the He family.

29:01.640 --> 29:03.080
Nothing good comes too late.

29:03.160 --> 29:05.520
The bridal sedan chair is about to arrive.

29:05.600 --> 29:07.960
Mom, are you afraid
your son-in-law will run away?

29:09.280 --> 29:10.120
Exactly.

29:10.200 --> 29:12.440
He is marrying such a beautiful bride.

29:12.520 --> 29:14.560
Why can't Mr. He wait?

29:14.640 --> 29:17.560
I guarantee that once he sees her,
he'll be fascinated.

29:21.480 --> 29:22.520
Mom.

29:22.600 --> 29:25.160
Are you that eager to send me off?

29:25.240 --> 29:27.240
You won't even let me
stay at home for a bit longer.

29:28.200 --> 29:29.800
You girl!

29:33.720 --> 29:37.240
Alright, everything is fine.

29:38.640 --> 29:41.360
I'm just worried about your temperament.

29:42.000 --> 29:46.480
He Guangyuan is gentle and soft.

29:46.560 --> 29:49.080
The He family is also quite well-off.

29:49.160 --> 29:52.040
They have a simple family.
After you marry into their family,

29:52.120 --> 29:55.800
your mother-in-law is kind,
and the sister-in-law knows etiquette.

29:55.880 --> 29:57.920
And you won't have to worry
about household affairs.

29:58.560 --> 30:01.720
You won't get wronged.

30:02.320 --> 30:05.800
But you must learn to control your temper.

30:06.520 --> 30:07.960
From now on,

30:08.040 --> 30:11.480
you should be kind to your in-laws
and considerate to your husband,

30:11.560 --> 30:13.600
becoming a nice wife
who supports her husband

30:13.680 --> 30:16.640
and teaches her children well.

30:17.320 --> 30:18.520
Do you hear me?

30:19.120 --> 30:21.200
Can you make me proud?

30:21.280 --> 30:23.240
You can't do whatever you want
like you do at home.

30:23.320 --> 30:24.440
Mom.

30:25.240 --> 30:27.600
Don't worry. I understand.

30:28.560 --> 30:31.600
Even if I marry,
I will always be a part of the Li family,

30:31.680 --> 30:33.840
upholding the instructions
of the Li family.

30:33.920 --> 30:36.160
As the old saying goes,
kind parents and filial sons,

30:36.240 --> 30:38.200
virtuous husbands and wise wives.

30:38.280 --> 30:41.840
The kind elders
and the virtuous husbands come first.

30:42.520 --> 30:43.680
After I marry off,

30:43.760 --> 30:46.440
if they respect me, I will be forgiving.

30:46.520 --> 30:48.480
I will never hit my in-laws
nor bully my husband.

30:48.560 --> 30:51.120
I will never bring shame
to the ancestors of the Li family.

30:53.040 --> 30:54.920
But if someone provokes me,

30:55.000 --> 30:57.400
I'm not a timid person,

30:57.480 --> 31:00.160
I might just beat him.

31:00.240 --> 31:03.760
If it happens, don't blame me
for being rude or un-filial.

31:04.440 --> 31:05.960
You! You girl!

31:06.040 --> 31:07.400
Mom, don't.

31:08.000 --> 31:11.040
On such a joyful day,
we can't make a scene and be laughed at.

31:11.120 --> 31:12.960
Wait. As her elder sisters, you should

31:13.040 --> 31:15.120
manage her well. What…

31:15.200 --> 31:16.520
Mom.

31:17.600 --> 31:18.920
The groom has arrived.

31:19.680 --> 31:20.720
Mom.

31:20.800 --> 31:22.640
Clean my room every day.

31:22.720 --> 31:24.840
I'm just taking a look.
If I'm not happy with the He family,

31:24.920 --> 31:25.920
- I'll come back.
- Let's go.

31:26.000 --> 31:27.960
- Okay.
- I'm just taking a look there.

31:28.040 --> 31:30.240
If I'm not happy with the He family,
I'll come back.

31:30.320 --> 31:31.400
Hey.

31:31.480 --> 31:32.560
Leshan.

31:32.640 --> 31:34.720
- Take it slow. Your bridal veil.
- Leshan.

31:34.800 --> 31:36.480
- Leshan, put on your bridal veil.
- Mother.

31:37.640 --> 31:39.920
I wonder what day today is.

31:40.440 --> 31:43.120
The dresser stands on the balcony
is getting closer.

31:43.200 --> 31:45.360
Some people say
that hibiscus grows in water,

31:46.080 --> 31:48.040
but it blooms in the bronze mirror.

31:48.120 --> 31:50.000
Good. Okay.

31:50.080 --> 31:53.840
What? It's not acceptable
to pass off with another's poem.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.520
Right, Yuanming is correct.

31:55.600 --> 31:57.240
It's not difficult
to invite the bride out.

31:57.320 --> 31:59.560
It depends on whether
you're sincere or not.

32:00.360 --> 32:03.800
Mr. Du, don't make things difficult.
You're the third-ranked scholar.

32:03.880 --> 32:05.520
- No one shows off in front of you.
- Right.

32:05.600 --> 32:07.840
For the sake of me, please let him pass.

32:07.920 --> 32:08.800
No way.

32:08.880 --> 32:09.880
- No way.
- No.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.120
- No way.
- No.

32:11.200 --> 32:13.360
On this wedding day,
there's no distinction between us.

32:13.440 --> 32:14.960
Moreover, Mr. He is different now.

32:15.040 --> 32:17.440
Do not act shy like a lady.

32:17.520 --> 32:19.800
If you have any skills, show us.

32:19.880 --> 32:22.240
You must show them off anyway.

32:22.320 --> 32:23.760
- Yes.
- Compose a poem and you'll pass.

32:24.640 --> 32:26.840
Greetings to you all.

32:26.920 --> 32:28.520
I pay my respects to you all.

32:28.600 --> 32:30.960
No, compose a poem.

32:31.040 --> 32:32.360
- Compose a poem.
- Compose a poem.

32:32.440 --> 32:34.520
It's noon.
The auspicious moment is about to pass.

32:35.280 --> 32:36.960
Please, please let the bride come out.

32:37.040 --> 32:37.880
- Poem.
- No.

32:37.960 --> 32:40.200
- You have to compose a poem.
- You can't get in otherwise.

32:41.240 --> 32:43.360
- Hurry up.
- You have to compose a poem.

32:43.440 --> 32:45.680
- Try.
- Give it a try.

32:49.040 --> 32:51.040
Joy fills the gate

32:53.200 --> 32:55.960
- Brightness illuminates the silk
- They have searched all the talents

32:56.040 --> 32:57.680
in Bianjing and chose this man,

32:57.760 --> 32:59.280
who's even shyer than Leshan.

32:59.360 --> 33:02.240
Look at him blushing all over.
He's become like the bride.

33:03.080 --> 33:04.280
Brightness…

33:04.360 --> 33:07.520
I heard from Haode
that the Li family is choosing a husband

33:07.600 --> 33:09.560
for Leshan differently.

33:09.640 --> 33:12.080
They choose one
that won't fight or talk back…

33:12.160 --> 33:14.880
- Brightness illuminates the silk
- …and never complain.

33:16.040 --> 33:18.480
Madam is discerning. Hurry up.

33:19.760 --> 33:22.040
Rouge brings color

33:22.120 --> 33:23.800
Green varnishes the palace

33:24.480 --> 33:25.920
- Alright, move.
- It's out of rhyme.

33:26.000 --> 33:27.160
- It's not a poem.
- No way.

33:27.240 --> 33:28.840
- Let me in first.
- No way.

33:28.920 --> 33:30.200
- The bride's come out.
- Let me in.

33:30.280 --> 33:31.920
- Let him in.
- Let him in.

33:32.000 --> 33:33.120
The bride has come out.

33:33.200 --> 33:34.800
- She's out.
- Forget it, Yuanming.

33:34.880 --> 33:36.640
- Here she comes.
- She's here.

33:36.720 --> 33:38.280
Wonderful.

33:44.600 --> 33:46.120
He's truly blessed.

33:46.840 --> 33:48.240
Such a great daughter-in-law.

33:55.000 --> 33:56.600
Bride, please go onto the sedan chair.

33:58.000 --> 33:58.960
Let's go.

34:03.640 --> 34:04.760
Mom.

34:08.920 --> 34:12.080
I'm here. Don't worry. Just go.

34:12.160 --> 34:14.160
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

34:33.360 --> 34:34.920
Welcoming happiness, dispatching joy.

34:35.000 --> 34:36.840
The bride sets off.

34:37.520 --> 34:39.680
- Good.
- Good.

34:39.760 --> 34:41.640
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

34:42.240 --> 34:44.160
- Congratulations.
- Bravo.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.000
Look how shy he is.

34:48.080 --> 34:49.160
May you have a child soon.

34:49.760 --> 34:50.760
Live a happy life.

34:50.840 --> 34:53.120
- Live a harmonious life forever.
- Bravo.

34:53.200 --> 34:54.720
- Congratulations.
- Great.

34:54.800 --> 34:56.120
Look how happy he is.

34:56.200 --> 34:58.360
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

35:00.280 --> 35:01.960
Leshan.

35:02.040 --> 35:05.640
Remember what I told you.

35:05.720 --> 35:07.840
Leshan.

35:29.320 --> 35:31.200
- Give me two.
- Okay.

35:32.240 --> 35:33.600
Whose family is having a wedding?

35:33.680 --> 35:34.880
What a good day.

35:45.920 --> 35:47.800
I wonder whose family is having a wedding.

35:48.720 --> 35:49.760
Master.

35:50.440 --> 35:52.080
- Tell him to make way.
- Yes.

35:53.880 --> 35:54.840
Stop, stop.

35:55.400 --> 35:57.600
Whose bridal sedan is this?

35:58.360 --> 36:00.080
You are not discerning at all.

36:00.160 --> 36:01.400
Make way.

36:02.080 --> 36:02.920
Make way.

36:03.000 --> 36:04.120
- Make way.
- Let us go through.

36:04.200 --> 36:05.760
- Move.
- Move.

36:06.320 --> 36:07.800
Which Yang family is it? So dominant.

36:07.880 --> 36:10.960
Master, his aunt is Concubine Yang,

36:11.040 --> 36:12.520
who personally raised His Majesty.

36:12.600 --> 36:14.160
He's related to the Empress Dowager,

36:14.240 --> 36:17.040
he has a sister in His Majesty's favor,
and just got promoted to imperial consort.

36:17.120 --> 36:18.720
We must not offend the imperial kins.

36:18.800 --> 36:20.080
Perhaps let them go first.

36:20.160 --> 36:21.360
Right, move way!

36:21.440 --> 36:22.840
Go, hurry!

36:22.920 --> 36:24.360
- Move.
- Move to the side!

36:30.760 --> 36:32.680
Hurry, to the side!

36:33.600 --> 36:35.160
- Master.
- Come.

36:35.240 --> 36:37.200
To the side.

36:40.600 --> 36:42.640
- Stand firm.
- Be careful.

36:42.720 --> 36:44.840
Be careful not to jostle the bride.

36:44.920 --> 36:47.480
Matron of honor, what happened?

36:47.560 --> 36:50.640
Do not fear. Everything is fine.
Don't let the bridal veil fall.

36:53.120 --> 36:54.640
The road's wide,
yet you bumped into us?

36:54.720 --> 36:55.640
You are too outrageous.

36:55.720 --> 36:57.960
- Put it down first.
- Put down.

36:58.040 --> 36:59.560
You!

36:59.640 --> 37:01.720
- What do you want?
- Fight him.

37:01.800 --> 37:03.680
- Being unreasonable, right?
- Leshan.

37:05.120 --> 37:06.560
Don't fight.

37:07.160 --> 37:08.800
- Don't fight.
- Stop it.

37:08.880 --> 37:09.800
Stop it.

37:09.880 --> 37:11.200
- Stop it.
- Stop it.

37:11.280 --> 37:12.560
Leshan, are you alright?

37:12.640 --> 37:13.600
Master.

37:14.760 --> 37:17.200
- Master.
- Why did you hit me?

37:17.800 --> 37:20.120
- Why did you hit me?
- Don't hit Master.

37:20.200 --> 37:21.280
Stop.

37:21.360 --> 37:22.400
Stop.

37:23.440 --> 37:24.360
Stop.

37:24.440 --> 37:25.920
Stop hitting, Master.

37:26.000 --> 37:27.000
It's a day of great joy.

37:27.080 --> 37:28.360
Stop it.

37:28.440 --> 37:29.520
- Stop it.
- Beat him.

37:29.600 --> 37:30.720
Stop it.

37:30.800 --> 37:32.320
Don't unveil it.

37:33.000 --> 37:34.320
- Help!
- Stop fighting.

37:34.400 --> 37:35.960
Matron of honor!

37:37.880 --> 37:38.720
- I'm here.
- Stop it.

37:38.800 --> 37:40.920
Before the ceremony is complete,
don't unveil it.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.680
Let me help you back into the sedan chair.

37:45.440 --> 37:46.280
- Come on.
- Be careful.

37:46.360 --> 37:47.960
- Over there, hurry up.
- Get him.

37:48.040 --> 37:49.000
- Careful.
- Watch out.

37:49.080 --> 37:50.640
- Make way!
- Hurry up.

37:50.720 --> 37:51.760
Right, this way.

37:51.840 --> 37:53.120
Be careful with the bridal veil.

37:53.200 --> 37:54.560
Hit them.

37:54.640 --> 37:56.640
- This way.
- Get out of the way!

37:56.720 --> 37:57.800
Help!

37:57.880 --> 37:59.800
Everyone, stop fighting!

37:59.880 --> 38:01.480
Both families are anxiously waiting.

38:01.560 --> 38:03.320
If we miss the moment,
we'll have to pick another.

38:03.400 --> 38:04.800
Stop it.

38:05.960 --> 38:07.560
- Let's go
- Stop!

38:07.640 --> 38:08.520
Stop fighting!

38:08.600 --> 38:10.640
Don't miss the auspicious moment.
Let's go.

38:11.280 --> 38:12.320
- Go
- Let's go.

38:12.400 --> 38:14.440
- Master.
- Matron of honor.

38:15.360 --> 38:16.560
Matron of honor.

38:16.640 --> 38:18.480
- Matron of honor.
- Hurry up and get in.

38:18.560 --> 38:20.280
Why are you coming out?

38:20.360 --> 38:22.080
Hurry up. Let's go.

38:22.160 --> 38:23.800
- How can there be such rude people…
- Hurry.

38:23.880 --> 38:25.560
- …in this world?
- Yes.

38:25.640 --> 38:27.880
- How dare you!
- You are outrageous.

38:28.480 --> 38:29.360
Master.

38:29.440 --> 38:31.480
All the relatives
are all waiting for the ceremony.

38:31.560 --> 38:33.680
It would be a pity to delay it.

38:33.760 --> 38:36.040
- No way, I must sue them.
- Let's go.

38:36.120 --> 38:37.160
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

38:37.240 --> 38:38.440
- You are outrageous.
- Sir.

38:38.520 --> 38:39.560
Alright, let's go.

38:39.640 --> 38:42.280
Master, that punch you threw
just now was amazing.

39:37.720 --> 39:39.520
This silly girl.

39:51.520 --> 39:52.880
Mom.

39:52.960 --> 39:56.000
You've been busy all day. I've made you
a bowl of dumplings.

39:56.080 --> 39:57.000
Please eat some.

39:58.120 --> 40:01.200
Why haven't you gone back yet?
Yangxi is coming to urge you.

40:01.280 --> 40:04.560
I told him to go back to pack up
and move back here early tomorrow.

40:04.640 --> 40:07.840
Move back here?
Did you two have an argument?

40:08.680 --> 40:10.880
Mother-in-law insists on returning
to the hometown.

40:10.960 --> 40:12.200
There are no elders at home.

40:12.280 --> 40:14.560
We're only separated by a wall.
I might as well move back.

40:15.560 --> 40:16.720
Besides,

40:16.800 --> 40:19.960
Yangxi said he marries into the Li family.

40:20.040 --> 40:22.480
It's only right for him to come over
and take care of you.

40:23.480 --> 40:24.640
Seriously?

40:25.560 --> 40:26.600
Of course.

40:26.680 --> 40:29.240
How about we all come back
and stay with you?

40:29.800 --> 40:32.280
Well, you all!

40:32.360 --> 40:33.440
What's going on?

40:34.120 --> 40:36.240
After Leshan gets married,
you must feel a bit lonely.

40:36.320 --> 40:39.280
We sisters have decided
to take turns coming back to live here.

40:39.360 --> 40:40.720
How about one in turn for a month?

40:40.800 --> 40:42.840
- Is it?
- Nonsense!

40:42.920 --> 40:46.040
No married daughter comes back
to live with her mother all the time.

40:46.120 --> 40:49.200
If you come back,
what about your husbands?

40:49.280 --> 40:51.360
Your in-laws will complain.

40:51.440 --> 40:52.600
Mom.

40:53.480 --> 40:56.960
We grew up without a father
and have been raised by you.

40:57.040 --> 40:58.960
If we forget our own mother
once we are married,

40:59.040 --> 41:00.920
who would want
such ruthless daughter-in-laws?

41:01.640 --> 41:02.840
Exactly.

41:02.920 --> 41:05.920
I'll go home and fulfill my filial duties.
If Fan Lianghan dares to object,

41:06.000 --> 41:07.400
I'll beat him.

41:09.840 --> 41:12.320
Next month, I'll bring Joy back
to keep you company, okay?

41:13.880 --> 41:14.920
No need.

41:15.000 --> 41:17.840
Mom, of all virtues,
filial piety is the greatest.

41:17.920 --> 41:19.520
In the Song, all mothers without sons

41:19.600 --> 41:20.880
have been supported by daughters.

41:21.800 --> 41:24.880
If we don't even have this right,
we don't deserve to be your daughters.

41:25.920 --> 41:27.000
Exactly.

41:35.600 --> 41:37.400
Good.

41:38.880 --> 41:41.160
The house is all ready.

41:41.240 --> 41:42.600
Every night,

41:42.680 --> 41:44.760
I go around each room

41:44.840 --> 41:46.800
and clean them all thoroughly.

41:49.800 --> 41:52.240
Okay, Mom. It's getting cold. Eat now.

41:52.320 --> 41:54.400
- Eat now.
- Eat up.

41:58.320 --> 42:02.000
I wonder how Leshan is doing.

42:03.440 --> 42:04.920
I hope this He Guangyuan

42:05.000 --> 42:07.680
makes fewer mistakes tonight.

42:07.760 --> 42:09.240
If he annoys Leshan,

42:09.320 --> 42:11.760
then he has to suffer tonight.

42:13.920 --> 42:16.200
Why are you like this?

42:16.280 --> 42:18.080
That's the truth.

42:19.280 --> 42:20.680
- Eat up.
- Mom.

42:20.760 --> 42:22.720
YANG MANSION

42:53.440 --> 42:56.880
Li Leshan, how are you?

42:56.960 --> 42:59.560
Do you still remember me?

43:00.760 --> 43:03.320
You're a woman,
so I won't make things difficult for you.

43:03.920 --> 43:06.920
As long as you kneel and beg for mercy,
swearing to be my maid for three years,

43:07.000 --> 43:09.920
to help me change clothes,
grind ink, and serve by my bed,

43:10.000 --> 43:13.120
then I will save your sister.
How about that?

43:14.480 --> 43:17.600
Master, I beg you to save my sister.

43:18.520 --> 43:21.200
I'm willing to be a maid.
Whatever will do.

43:22.560 --> 43:26.240
Li Leshan, you promised me so
when you begged me

43:26.840 --> 43:29.440
to save your fourth sister.

43:30.680 --> 43:33.000
I went through great hardships
to destroy the thieves' den,

43:33.080 --> 43:34.400
kill the bandits,

43:35.080 --> 43:36.960
and save your fourth sister.

43:37.040 --> 43:39.160
But you've hidden
in the Li house ever since,

43:39.240 --> 43:41.040
going against your promise.

43:41.760 --> 43:44.400
Now, I don't need you to bother coming.

43:44.480 --> 43:48.040
I'll personally bring you here
in a bridal sedan chair. How about it?

43:49.480 --> 43:50.920
You exchanged the bridal sedan chair?

43:52.680 --> 43:54.800
Yes, I did.

43:55.840 --> 43:56.840
Yang Xian.

43:56.920 --> 43:59.480
You bullied me, such a vulnerable girl,
and took advantage of me.

43:59.560 --> 44:01.920
The Shen and Li families
brought you generous gifts as thanks.

44:02.000 --> 44:03.120
You thought it's not enough.

44:04.560 --> 44:06.600
Marriage is an important event.

44:06.680 --> 44:10.160
This affects my whole life,
yet you dare pull such a trick.

44:10.760 --> 44:12.080
Yang Xian.

44:12.160 --> 44:13.760
You are arrogant, despicable,

44:13.840 --> 44:15.280
inhuman, and lowly.

44:17.920 --> 44:20.560
You are the one who's ungrateful.
How dare you scold me here!

44:21.800 --> 44:25.160
I don't want jewels as thanks.
I want you to keep your promise.

44:25.960 --> 44:30.160
Now, we've bowed to the heaven and earth
and completed the wedding ceremony.

44:30.240 --> 44:32.080
We are a couple now.

44:32.680 --> 44:34.480
- You can't regret it.
- You!

44:36.040 --> 44:39.080
The wedding night
is a rare beautiful night.

44:39.840 --> 44:42.800
Have a cup of wedding wine with me.

44:42.880 --> 44:43.960
From now on,

44:44.040 --> 44:46.560
if you respect me

44:47.200 --> 44:49.120
and serve me well,

44:49.800 --> 44:51.360
then I will spare you.

44:51.440 --> 44:53.880
If you dare to lose your temper,
speak disrespectfully,

44:54.520 --> 44:56.600
or provoke me again…

45:02.240 --> 45:04.800
Li Leshan, how dare you hit me?

45:07.160 --> 45:08.160
I…

45:08.920 --> 45:10.880
Li Leshan, how dare you hit me?

45:10.960 --> 45:12.600
- You shrew!
- You heinous man!

45:12.680 --> 45:13.640
I…

45:15.240 --> 45:17.120
How dare you mess with me?

45:17.200 --> 45:19.680
I must beat you until you crawl.

45:21.600 --> 45:23.680
- I--
- Go away.

45:35.360 --> 45:36.600
You heinous man!

45:41.280 --> 45:42.320
What's wrong?

45:42.400 --> 45:43.480
Xian.

45:43.560 --> 45:45.600
- Xian.
- Don't come over.

45:48.680 --> 45:49.640
MADAM LUO

45:49.720 --> 45:51.120
YANG DEMAO

45:53.400 --> 45:56.400
I am Li Leshan from Sifu House
on Pan Restaurant Street.

45:56.480 --> 45:58.000
On my wedding day,

45:58.600 --> 45:59.880
your son snatched me away,

45:59.960 --> 46:02.080
forcing me to be his wife.

46:04.600 --> 46:07.880
Hurry and inform the Li family.
If you dare delay,

46:08.600 --> 46:10.920
- I'll take his life.
- Don't.

46:11.000 --> 46:12.360
- Mom.
- Mom.

46:12.440 --> 46:13.480
- Go to the Li family.
- Mom.

46:13.560 --> 46:14.840
Go!

46:14.920 --> 46:15.920
Don't act rashly.

46:19.680 --> 46:21.840
Crying, that's all you know.

46:21.920 --> 46:24.040
Your son has caused big trouble.

46:24.120 --> 46:27.240
The Yan's daughter is from a distinguished
family, virtuous and upright,

46:27.320 --> 46:29.400
praised by everyone in Bianjing.

46:29.480 --> 46:30.960
What is there for him to nitpick?

46:31.560 --> 46:34.800
He insisted on switching to a shrewish

46:34.880 --> 46:36.960
and fierce girl
who pays no respect to her elders.

46:37.040 --> 46:38.920
He just wants to drive me crazy.

46:39.000 --> 46:41.960
It's not my son who made the switch.
It was the heavens' doing.

46:42.880 --> 46:44.400
You are the cousin of Concubine Yang,

46:44.480 --> 46:47.080
yet you can't even deal
with such an ignorant girl.

46:47.160 --> 46:50.240
Just have the servant go tie her up.
Wouldn't that solve everything?

46:50.320 --> 46:52.000
You stupid woman!

46:52.600 --> 46:54.320
The Li family is a humble family,

46:54.400 --> 46:56.240
but her fourth brother-in-law

46:56.320 --> 46:59.240
is Shen Huizhao,
the ruthless judge of Kaifeng Court.

46:59.320 --> 47:02.880
And her eldest sister got married
to the third-ranked scholar Du Yangxi.

47:03.480 --> 47:04.600
Who are they?

47:05.320 --> 47:07.840
They are the intimate officials
to His Majesty.

47:07.920 --> 47:11.200
If the Li family accused us
to His Majesty,

47:11.280 --> 47:13.160
even with Concubine Yang as a guarantor,

47:13.240 --> 47:14.800
we can't escape the punishment.

47:14.880 --> 47:16.840
But she has already
married into our family.

47:16.920 --> 47:19.560
She has become one of us.

47:19.640 --> 47:21.840
Not to mention
upholding women's virtues and integrity.

47:21.920 --> 47:22.840
She wouldn't accuse us.

47:23.520 --> 47:24.920
If she makes a scene,

47:25.000 --> 47:27.320
she'd be so ashamed.

47:30.440 --> 47:32.320
You are a faithful widow,

47:32.400 --> 47:33.920
having shame and dignity.

47:34.000 --> 47:37.600
But that shrew
doesn't fear being humiliated.

47:37.680 --> 47:39.840
Enough. Stop it.

47:39.920 --> 47:41.200
Chaozong.

47:43.000 --> 47:45.440
Father, I have already asked someone
to go to the Li family.

47:45.520 --> 47:47.920
Of course, you must go to the Li family.

47:48.000 --> 47:51.080
Prepare a generous gift.
You go visit the He family.

47:51.760 --> 47:54.480
Also, send someone
to the palace immediately

47:55.320 --> 47:57.040
and ask for instructions from the Consort.

50:29.840 --> 50:32.680
Subtitle translation by: Wina Huang
